    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo is delighted to present 11 Dolphin Road to the market. This fully renovated four-bedroom end-of-terrace home extends to approximately 97 sq. m. and sits on a generous corner site in Maudlintown, a short walk from Wexford town centre. Freshly renovated inside and out, the house is in turnkey condition.\r\n\r\nAn entrance porch opens to a bright panelled hallway. The open-plan living and dining room measures approximately 3.13 m x 6.20 m and is centred on a new stove set in a feature fireplace. To the rear, the kitchen measures approximately 3.45 m x 3.02 m and has fitted units, a built-in oven, hob and dishwasher.\r\n\r\nThere are four bedrooms, two on each floor. At ground level, a double bedroom of approximately 2.48 m x 3.31 m has its own walk-in wardrobe, with a single bedroom alongside. Upstairs, the main bedroom measures approximately 3.14 m x 3.21 m and has built-in storage, and there is a further single bedroom. A large family bathroom with bath and separate shower, and a separate WC, complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside, private gates open onto off-street parking. A substantial side garden with shed and an easy-care rear yard complete the site. The house has external wall insulation, a new oil boiler and a replacement rubber flat roof, and has a C2 BER rating (BER No. 102527520).\r\n\r\nWith generous space, a finished interior and a walkable town location, 11 Dolphin Road is likely to appeal to families and first-time buyers alike.\r\n\r\nInterior Highlights\r\n\r\nLiving Spaces: A magnificent, light-filled open-plan sitting and dining room, expertly decorated to offer a contemporary, welcoming ambiance.\r\n\r\nBedrooms: Four bedrooms finished with modern flair, 2 with walk in closest.\r\n\r\nBathrooms: A large, elegant family bathroom complemented by an additional separate washroom for convenience.\r\n\r\nTurnkey Condition: Modern interior finishes throughout mean zero additional work is required before moving in.\r\n\r\nExterior & Grounds\r\n\r\nExpansive Side Garden: A substantial side plot offering incredible lawn space, outdoor entertaining options, or future expansion potential, cpme with garden shed.\r\n\r\nRear Yard: A back yard ideal for easy maintenance, outdoor dining, or extra storage.\r\n\r\nGated Driveway: Secure off-street parking accessed via private gates.\r\n\r\nEnergy Efficiency: Fully wrapped with external wall insulation for reduced heating costs.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nDolphin Road is a quiet residential street in Maudlintown, on the south side of Wexford town close to The Faythe. There is a Londis shop around the corner on The Faythe, Tesco Extra on Distillery Road is approximately 13 minutes' walk, and Wexford's Main Street, with its shops, cafés, restaurants and pubs, is around 17 minutes on foot. A choice of primary and secondary schools is within walking distance.\r\n\r\nCrescent Quay and the harbour front are approximately 18 minutes' walk, and the National Opera House is around 21 minutes. Wexford O'Hanrahan Station and the bus stops at Redmond Square are about 27 minutes on foot or 8 minutes by car, with rail links to Dublin.\r\n\r\nFurther afield, Johnstown Castle and its gardens are approximately 8 minutes' drive, Rosslare Europort is around 18 minutes and Curracloe Beach is about 20 minutes by car. Wexford General Hospital is approximately 11 minutes' drive.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
